      "title": "LBNL Queued Up: interconnection queue dataset",
      "summary": "All seven US ISO/RTO interconnection queues plus non-ISO utilities, harmonised into one schema.",
      "description": "Berkeley Lab's annual harmonisation of US interconnection queues. Every ISO publishes its own schema, statuses and capacity conventions; this dataset resolves them into one. DD3's structural note is blunt about the consequence: LBNL has already solved this normalisation once and it should not be re-solved.",
